# trace_auditor.py AI Check

- [ ] Audit already-structured ReasoningDag data; do not extract natural-language events.
- [ ] Emit trace-family observations for branch, failure, revisit, reuse, merge and recovery patterns.
- [ ] Treat missing required trace families as scientific FAIL, not protocol PASS.
- [ ] If a State Normalizer sidecar is supplied, enforce DAG hash, occurrence set and topological order compatibility.
- [ ] Reject malformed DAGs, unknown edge endpoints and duplicate edge IDs fail-closed.
- [ ] Record zero model/Devin/DB/Solver/file-write side effects.
- [ ] Import no model, Solver, database, network, or subprocess dependency.
